{"3727600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "All the Promised Burn - An Yssaia Game", "steam_appid": 3727600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727600/extras/e90263984e973a7da2db0da66c0a10d8.webp?t=1786677063\" width=818 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;All promised heroes burn. Who are they now?&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a war-torn world of fated heroes, flawed philosophies, and bunny-eared Demons, a burned assassin girl must find a new life purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All the Promised Burn: An Yssaia Game</i> is a hand-drawn Knowledge-based RPG. Navigate an assassin through her delicate, brutal world after the War annexed her homeland. Collect artifacts to increase your knowledge and unlock more of the dark corners of the world and your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727600/extras/0a40986b0c02b315c9beadf41a22f25d.webp?t=1786677063\" width=53 height=56 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727600/extras/0a40986b0c02b315c9beadf41a22f25d.webp?t=1786677063\" width=53 height=56 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727600/extras/0a40986b0c02b315c9beadf41a22f25d.webp?t=1786677063\" width=53 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features</u>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coil through an epic of 10 POV characters and trip on every wound in their hearts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indulge in a full suite of fantasy disabilities, armistice logistics, &amp; tearful melt-downs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather 400+ books, recipes, creatures, and epistolaries for your lore archive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riff through 8 fully Constructed Languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel mysteries from across the selvages of this little open world</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727600/extras/e90263984e973a7da2db0da66c0a10d8.webp?t=1786677063\" width=818 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Additional Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sin-eating</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Murdered lovers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fictional Theatre Drama</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diversity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Angst</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727600/extras/394e40abc290632eb72d5aacb66d1ab3.avif?t=1786677063\" width=900 height=600 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727600/extras/e90263984e973a7da2db0da66c0a10d8.webp?t=1786677063\" width=818 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;All promised heroes burn. Who are they now?&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a war-torn world of fated heroes, flawed philosophies, and bunny-eared Demons, a burned assassin girl must find a new life purpose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>All the Promised Burn: An Yssaia Game</i> is a hand-drawn Knowledge-based RPG. Navigate an assassin through her delicate, brutal world after the War annexed her homel